SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:Triplex Cinema\, 70 Railroad St\, Great Barrington\, MA 01230
DESCRIPTION:Times: 12:15pm\, 4pm\, 7:45pm\nThirty-four days before she's se
 nt to prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a
  skeptical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intimat
 e portrait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year journey
  into the abyss.\nhttps://www.thetriplex.org/movie/you-can-see-everything\
 nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.thetriplex.org/movie/you-can-see-everything
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eeebefadeafa2fbc0de5d11f69aaa71bd50a5582@pushpin.city
